Package: cdmSemantic
Title: Shared Semantic Utilities for CDM Methodology Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Independent Impact", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "info@independentimpact.org")
Description: Provides shared utilities for semantic applicability checking
    across CDM methodology R packages. Bundles the CDM SKOS concept scheme
    (cdm-concepts.ttl) and exports helper functions for resolving project
    triples (from Fluree or local data frames), materialising the SKOS
    hierarchy, and building standardised applicability result lists.
